WELCOME TO THE TANDY 200
========================
New to VirtualT? Start with the Model
100: it has the tour and most of the
programs. Quit with Ctrl+Esc, start
VirtualT again and press 1 during the
countdown under the screen.

The Tandy 200's own programs are in
its library (Ctrl+F4); PROGRAMS.TXT on
the SD card describes them. Shift+F3
(F8) leaves this file.
